  - key: PAYTABLE_SYMBOL_DESCRIPTION_0
    value: <size=22>ANY COMBINATION OF THREE</style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_1
    value: '<style=title><size=32>Red-Hot Pizza Bonus

      </style>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_1
    value: <size=18>1 Reel</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_2
    value: <size=18>2 Reel</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_3
    value: <size=18>3 Reel</size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_PAGE_2_4
    value: "<size=14.5\n>- Red-Hot Pizza Bonus has independent reel spins.\n\n- Pizza
      Symbol or Jackpot Symbol on a reel makes one piece of pizza meter above the
      same reel. \n     - Pizza Symbol: Pizza Symbol appears with random cash value
      on it. Each cash amount is accumulated on the same reel where it\n       appears.
      \n     - Jackpot Symbol: Jackpot Symbol is accumulated on the reel whenever
      it appears. If 3 Jackpot Symbols collected, then Grand Jackpot\n       is activated.
      \n\n- Pizza has 5 pieces in total and one pizza piece is deduced each spin.\n\n-
      Pizza Symbol or Jackpot Symbol re-sets remaining pieces to 5 pizza pieces. \n\n-
      If Collect Symbol appears before all pizza pieces disappear, player wins the
      accumulated amount of Cash Values from Pizza Symbols  \n   and Jackpot if any.
      \n\n- If none of Pizza Symbols or Jackpot Symbols or Collect Symbols appears
      before all pizza pieces are gone, then accumulated cash\n   amounts and Jackpot
      re-set.</size>"
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_PAGE_2
